The '''Esports World Cup''' (or '''EWC''' in short) is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series. It was originally planned to be hosted in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, but was moved to Paris, France on May 20.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup|author-link=Esports World Cup|date=2026-05-20}}</ref>

'''Trackmania''' was announced as part of the game titles line-up on January 19th, 2026.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2013235041451585848|title=Where precision defines champions.|date=2026-01-19|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} ''English''}}</ref>

:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2026 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2026, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

