==Format==
* Cup mode
** Point repartition per round: 10, 6, 4, 3
** All matches have 140-point limit
* Tiebreaker:
** Points after reaching Finalist status are counted with no limits.
** If Points are equal, last round results determinates position
* <span class="mw-customtoggle-SMbp" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for Seeding, Map ban and picks''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-SMbp" style="margin-top:10px;" style="margin-left:45px;">
* Before tournament, every player is seeded
* Players are reseeded by the previous results whenether demoted to Lower Bracket or entering ''Playoffs''
* Process of maps bans and picks:
** Seed 1 ban last map, pick Map 1
** Seed 2 ban third map, pick Map 2
** Seed 3 ban second map, pick Map 3
** Seed 4 ban first map, pick Map 4
** Map 5 is randomly picked out of two available
</div></div>
* '''Group Stage''' - ''19th - 21st August 2026''
** Each match has two Winners
** Double Elimination Bracket
** 16 players per group
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 16}} (8 per group) players moves on to the Finals
* '''Finals''' - ''22nd August 2026''
** Single Elimination Bracket
** Each match ''(excl. Grand Final)'' has two Winners
** Grand Final has one Winner

